  HH heads D=[3, 2, 1]  s=3  residue=n-s=2   alpha-1=2
  min_B deg = 3  (tau+1 = 3)  hypothesis (i): True
  N2 RHS  Delta + tau(tau+1)/2 - 1 = 5   m = 6   -> unqualified N2 FALSE
  reductio standpoint residue==alpha ? False  -> patched N2 vacuous here
  contrapositive form: m > RHS and indeed residue=2 <= alpha-1=2 : True
  K_{2,3}                      s=[3]  D=[(3, 2, 1)]  #distinct-K=5  violations=0

