(2c) CONTROL (d): K_6 vs Corollary CNT (with and without the min)
  K_6: s=5 D=[5, 4, 3, 2, 1] residue=1 alpha=1 tau=5 hs=10 m=15 Delta=5
  CNT with min : min(tau,hs+1)*Delta + sum = 5*5 + 0 = 25   (m=15) -> holds
  CNT min DROPPED, sum form : (hs+1)*Delta + sum = 55   -> holds (WEAKER, not false!)
  CLOSED form (hs+1)Delta + t(t+1)/2 - (hs+1)(hs+2)/2 = 4  -> FALSE
  NOTE: the closed form is only equal to the sum when hs+2 <= tau+1,
        i.e. hs <= tau-1.  Here hs=10 > tau-1=4, empty sum vs negative.

